WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.620
Welcome aboard.

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:06.511
We are going to follow one breath from your nose deep into your lungs and out to your cells.

00:00:06.511 --> 00:00:11.781
At each of nine stops, predict what happens, explain it aloud, then see what really goes on.
